# The LosOS root public key (Ed25519, 64 hex characters on one line).
#
# Every box ships this file (losos.proxy.officialRootKeyFile). An edge is
# "official" only if it presents a certificate signed by the matching private
# key and answers a fresh nonce with that certificate's key; only official
# edges may process P2P storage and compute trading (the market). Edges a
# company runs for itself still get discovery and storage sharing.
#
# The private half is held offline by the project owner and never enters this
# repository. Until a key is written below, no edge is official and the market
# is off on every box built from this tree (fail closed).
#
# Made and published from the operator's own machine, behind a GitHub
# sign-in against backend-registrar/operators.json:
#
#   losos-registrar provision root-keygen --out root.key --publish
#   losos-registrar provision edge --name "LosOS edge Berlin" \
#       --url https://register.losos.cfd --ssh root@edge.example --root-key root.key
#
# See wiki/Master-Proxy.md, "Official edges", and provisioning/edge-identity/README.md.
